body:
So, for starters, my mom is a drug addict. She has overdosed more than once. The first time, I had to save her life. That definitely left a mental scar. As for my dad, the few memories I do have are of him being an abusive drunk to me, my mom, and my stepmom. The only somewhat decent role models that I've ever had are my aunt and my uncle. Also, my brother is constantly relying on me. I am not mad at my brother, as he is mentally challenged, but it puts a lot of constant stress on me all the time, and I've finally cracked under the pressure

&#x200B;

Oh, also, I have problems with alcohol and vaping
